00:38:47.946 --> 00:38:50.560
They look at mortality, and

00:38:50.561 --> 00:38:52.735
with all the Boehner
on Healthcare,

00:38:52.736 --> 00:38:55.760
mortality keeps going down

00:38:55.761 --> 00:38:58.130
